ine Elder\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nSchool of Earth and Space Exploration, Arizona State University, Tempe, AZ 85287, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0009-0007-6418-2498](https://orcid.org/0009-0007-6418-2498)Dale Gary\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nCenter for Solar-Terrestrial Research, New Jersey Institute of Technology, Newark, NJ 07102, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2520-8396](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2520-8396)Charlie Harnach\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USAJack Hickish\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nReal-Time Radio Systems Ltd, Bournemouth, Dorset, BH6 3LU, UK\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0216-1417](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0216-1417)Rick Hobbs\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USADavid Hodge\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nCahill Center for Astronomy and Astrophysics, California Institute of Technology, Pasadena, CA 91125, USA; nakosogorov@gmail.com, nkosogor@caltech.eduMark Hodges\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USAYuping Huang\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nCahill Center for Astronomy and Astrophysics, California Institute of Technology, Pasadena, CA 91125, USA; nakosogorov@gmail.com, nkosogor@caltech.edu\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4267-6108](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4267-6108)Andrea Isella\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nDepartment of Physics and Astronomy, Rice University, Houston, TX 77005, USA\n\nRice Space Institute, Rice University, Houston, TX 77005, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8061-2207](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8061-2207)Daniel C. Jacobs\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nSchool of Earth and Space Exploration, Arizona State University, Tempe, AZ 85287, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0917-2269](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0917-2269)Ghislain Kemby\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USAJohn T. Klinefelter\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USAMatthew Kolopanis\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nSchool of Earth and Space Exploration, Arizona State University, Tempe, AZ 85287, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2950-2974](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2950-2974)James Lamb\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5959-1285](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5959-1285)Casey Law\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nCahill Center for Astronomy and Astrophysics, California Institute of Technology, Pasadena, CA 91125, USA; nakosogorov@gmail.com, nkosogor@caltech.edu\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4119-9963](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4119-9963)Nivedita Mahesh\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nCahill Center for Astronomy and Astrophysics, California Institute of Technology, Pasadena, CA 91125, USA; nakosogorov@gmail.com, nkosogor@caltech.edu\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2560-8023](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2560-8023)Surajit Mondal\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nNational Centre for Radio Astrophysics, Tata Institute of Fundamental Research, Pune University Campus, Pune 411007, India\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2325-5298](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2325-5298)Brian O’Donnell\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nCenter for Solar-Terrestrial Research, New Jersey Institute of Technology, Newark, NJ 07102, USA\n\n[https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2802-850X](https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2802-850X)Kathryn Plant\n\nAFFILIATIONS\n\nOwens Valley Radio Observatory, California Institute of Technology, Big Pine, CA 93513, USA\n\nJet Propulsion Laboratory, California Institute of Technology, Pasadena, CA 91011, USA\n\nNatio